  "title": "Besjaar® Douchekop – 3 Standen – Waterbesparend – Chroom",
  "body_html": "<div style=\"color:#11110E;line-height:1.55;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:1.35em;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#153252;margin:0 0 .6em;\">Volle straal. Maximaal 8 liter per minuut.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 1.2em;\">De Besjaar Douchekop verrijkt het water met lucht: een volle, gelijkmatige straal bij maximaal 8 liter per minuut. Drie standen – regen, massage en power – wissel je met één knop. Krachtig waar het moet, zuinig waar het kan.</p>\n<div style=\"background:#EEF6FB;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin:0 0 1.2em;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:.8em;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:600;color:#49627D;margin:0 0 .7em;line-height:1.4;text-transform:none;\">Wat je merkt</h2>\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;\">\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Maximaal 8 liter per minuut (rekenvoorbeeld: een kop van 16 liter per minuut verbruikt twee keer zoveel)</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>3 standen: zachte regen, massage, krachtige power-straal</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Extra brede kop van 13 cm</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Siliconen sproeiers: kalk wrijf je met een vinger weg</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0 0 .55em;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Chroomafwerking</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:0;font-size:.95em;color:#0F2947;\">\n<span style=\"flex:0 0 18px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#153252;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-top:2px;\">✓</span><span>Handvast gemonteerd, zonder gereedschap</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:.8em;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:600;color:#49627D;margin:0 0 .7em;line-height:1.4;text-transform:none;\">In de doos</h2>\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 1.2em;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;\">\n<li style=\"margin:0;font-size:.85em;color:#153252;border:1px solid #C9DBE8;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;line-height:1.3;\">Besjaar Douchekop</li>\n<li style=\"margin:0;font-size:.85em;color:#153252;border:1px solid #C9DBE8;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;line-height:1.3;\">Waterbesparend onderdeel</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:.8em;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:600;color:#49627D;margin:0 0 .3em;line-height:1.4;text-transform:none;\">Specificaties</h2>\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 1.2em;font-size:.95em;\">\n<li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6EEF4;\">\n<span style=\"color:#49627D;\">Sproeistanden</span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">3</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6EEF4;\">\n<span style=\"color:#49627D;\">Waterverbruik</span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">max. 8 l/min</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6EEF4;\">\n<span style=\"color:#49627D;\">Diameter</span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">13 cm</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6EEF4;\">\n<span style=\"color:#49627D;\">Aansluiting</span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">Universeel G½, past op elke standaard doucheslang</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6EEF4;\">\n<span style=\"color:#49627D;\">Slang en filter</span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">Niet inbegrepen</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;margin:0;\">\n<span style=\"color:#49627D;\">Afwerking</span><span style=\"text-align:right;\">Chroom</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 1.2em;font-size:.95em;color:#49627D;\">Liever gefilterd water? Kies de <a href=\"/products/besjaar-hoge-druk-douchekop-met-filter-model-1002025-10-sproeistanden-waterbesparende-zilver\" style=\"color:#153252;text-decoration:underline;\">Besjaar Douchekop met Filter</a>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #E6EEF4;font-weight:600;color:#153252;\">Besjaar. Douchen met een volle straal.</p>\n</div>",
